{"id":"a944261792aad989","group":"92","path":"92/92-prop-consistency-omega.md","title":"Omega Consistency Implies Consistency","display":"prop-consistency-omega — Omega Consistency Implies Consistency","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems","book_abbrev":"92","label":"92-prop-consistency-omega","aliases":["92-prop-consistency-omega"],"display":"prop-consistency-omega — Omega Consistency Implies Consistency","depends_on":["[[92-df-consistent]]","[[92-df-omega-consistency]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"Gödel's Incompleteness Theorems"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"92"},{"key":"label","html":"92-prop-consistency-omega"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>92-prop-consistency-omega</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-consistency-omega — Omega Consistency Implies Consistency"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> (the fixed arithmetic system)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"c7befd96bd551ade\" href=\"?note=c7befd96bd551ade\" title=\"92-df-consistent\">92-df-consistent</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span> (omega consistency, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}omega}\\vdash\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}omega}\\vdash\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> : <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}\\)</span> : 普通一致性</li>\n<li>该蕴涵直接来自<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"b15ebe94f199828c\" href=\"?note=b15ebe94f199828c\" title=\"92-df-omega-consistency\">92-df-omega-consistency</a>中把<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(G)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\)</span>列为合取项的定义</li>\n<li>逆命题一般失败，因此<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性严格强于普通一致性；但一个形式化的严格性见证必须具体给出理论、语言与证明编码，不能借助未定义的类<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{ArithSys}_G\">\\(\\mathsf{ArithSys}_G\\)</span>无条件断言存在</li>\n<li>例如，在满足第二不完备性定理与逐个证明码验证条件的相容基理论<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\">\\(T\\)</span>上，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T+\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_T\">\\(T+\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_T\\)</span>给出标准的相容但<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>不一致候选；其相容性仍是相对于<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}(T)\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}(T)\\)</span>的元理论结论</li>\n<li>Gödel原始证明需要<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega\">\\(\\omega\\)</span>一致性</li>\n<li>Rosser证明只需要普通一致性</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-consistent]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[92-df-omega-consistency]]","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-consistent","status":"resolved","id":"c7befd96bd551ade","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (consistency, see [[92-df-consistent]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)$ (omega consistency, see [[92-df-omega-consistency]])","embed":false},{"target":"92-df-omega-consistency","status":"resolved","id":"b15ebe94f199828c","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"该蕴涵直接来自[[92-df-omega-consistency]]中把$\\mathrm{Con}(G)$列为合取项的定义","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}consistency\\text{-}omega}\\vdash\n\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}(G)\\Longrightarrow\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":true},{"tex":"\\omega\\text{-}\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(G)","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{ArithSys}_G","display":false},{"tex":"T","display":false},{"tex":"T+\\neg\\mathrm{Con}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Con}(T)